+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project's recorded decision is to use an LRU (Least Recently Used) cache eviction policy with a 300-second TTL for cached entries. This hybrid approach combines recency-based eviction with time-based expiration, ensuring stale entries are purged even if frequently accessed, while newer or frequently-accessed items are retained longer within the TTL window.
